  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You tear the life essence out of a creature within range, which makes a Constitution saving throw. On a failure, it takes 4d4 Force damage and you gain Temporary Hit Points equal to half the Force damage dealt. On a success, it only takes half as much damage.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> The damage increases by 1d4 for each spell slot level above 1.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-J6DDJCDz9ICxxjHB\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>On a failed save, give yourself Temporary Hit Points equal to half the damage dealt.</p></section>",
